  {
    q: "My wood-fired oven dome has a crack. Can you repair it?",
    a: "We diagnose and document the crack pattern. Refractory work (dome and floor stone repair) is a specialty masonry trade that we coordinate with rather than perform directly, because heavy refractory work requires specific masonry equipment and certifications. Minor cracks ($800 to $1,800 typical with referral coordination) versus major dome damage ($3,000 to $8,000+) determined on-site. We document and refer; partner specialty contractors handle the masonry work; we re-commission the oven post-repair."
